    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro Hyper Racing\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the ultimate adrenaline-fueled racing experience! Nitro Hyper Racing brings you high-speed action, intense competition, and stunning tracks that will test your skills to the limit. Race against AI opponents in thrilling circuits, master sharp turns, and unleash your nitro boost to dominate the competition. This high-speed arcade racer blends stunning visuals, realistic physics, and intense AI competition to deliver the electrifying racing experiences on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/e891c47ff03bd2bd773a15cdd6758255.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/e891c47ff03bd2bd773a15cdd6758255.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/e891c47ff03bd2bd773a15cdd6758255.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your driving skills to the limit as you navigate through dynamic tracks, face off against intelligent AI rivals at breakneck speeds. drifting through sharp turns in a jungle track where every race needs a test of skill, reflexes, and strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to claim victory?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/fb70c56e331fe2d5e4f99a6b418ff320.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/fb70c56e331fe2d5e4f99a6b418ff320.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/fb70c56e331fe2d5e4f99a6b418ff320.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed Racing</strong> - Feel the rush of pure speed with realistic acceleration and drifting physics. Experience a perfect blend of real-world physics making every drift, boost, and overtake feel exhilarating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic &amp; Diverse Racing Tracks</strong> - Race across a variety of stunning designed environments, including night cities, Slippery roads, off-road forest routes, and snowy circuits.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Rivals</strong> \u2013 Compete against intelligent AI opponents that adapt to your racing style making every race unpredictable.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nitro Boost System</strong> \u2013 use your nitro boost to gain an edge over competitors. Time your nitro usage perfectly to leave your rivals in the dust. Save your Time that's right for high-speed overtakes and last-lap comebacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Race Modes</strong> \u2013 Experience intense single-player tournaments, time trials, and season-based challenges to prove your dominance on the races tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Selection &amp; Customization</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of high-performance cars and customize their paint colors, decals, textures, handling and speed upgrades to suit your racing style. Unlock new cars and tracks as you advance through the game.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/606dd3feae1c38b07bd131eb4ff79471.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/606dd3feae1c38b07bd131eb4ff79471.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/606dd3feae1c38b07bd131eb4ff79471.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Features &amp; Keywords</strong>:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style racing with realistic physics\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense AI battles with unpredictable racing patterns\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather effects (snow, and night racing for added challenge)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift, overtake and boost mechanics for high-speed cornering\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging visuals and smooth controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/1658180f043efde42dd4456bfb164989.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/1658180f043efde42dd4456bfb164989.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/1658180f043efde42dd4456bfb164989.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buckle up, hit the gas, and become the ultimate champion in Nitro Hyper Racing! Are you ready to dominate the roads and claim the championship?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/8747c1f158c048655f575004416325cf.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/8747c1f158c048655f575004416325cf.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/8747c1f158c048655f575004416325cf.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro Hyper Racing\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the ultimate adrenaline-fueled racing experience! Nitro Hyper Racing brings you high-speed action, intense competition, and stunning tracks that will test your skills to the limit. Race against AI opponents in thrilling circuits, master sharp turns, and unleash your nitro boost to dominate the competition. This high-speed arcade racer blends stunning visuals, realistic physics, and intense AI competition to deliver the electrifying racing experiences on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/e891c47ff03bd2bd773a15cdd6758255.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/e891c47ff03bd2bd773a15cdd6758255.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/e891c47ff03bd2bd773a15cdd6758255.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your driving skills to the limit as you navigate through dynamic tracks, face off against intelligent AI rivals at breakneck speeds. drifting through sharp turns in a jungle track where every race needs a test of skill, reflexes, and strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to claim victory?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/fb70c56e331fe2d5e4f99a6b418ff320.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/fb70c56e331fe2d5e4f99a6b418ff320.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/fb70c56e331fe2d5e4f99a6b418ff320.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed Racing</strong> - Feel the rush of pure speed with realistic acceleration and drifting physics. Experience a perfect blend of real-world physics making every drift, boost, and overtake feel exhilarating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic &amp; Diverse Racing Tracks</strong> - Race across a variety of stunning designed environments, including night cities, Slippery roads, off-road forest routes, and snowy circuits.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Rivals</strong> \u2013 Compete against intelligent AI opponents that adapt to your racing style making every race unpredictable.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nitro Boost System</strong> \u2013 use your nitro boost to gain an edge over competitors. Time your nitro usage perfectly to leave your rivals in the dust. Save your Time that's right for high-speed overtakes and last-lap comebacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Race Modes</strong> \u2013 Experience intense single-player tournaments, time trials, and season-based challenges to prove your dominance on the races tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Selection &amp; Customization</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of high-performance cars and customize their paint colors, decals, textures, handling and speed upgrades to suit your racing style. Unlock new cars and tracks as you advance through the game.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/606dd3feae1c38b07bd131eb4ff79471.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/606dd3feae1c38b07bd131eb4ff79471.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/606dd3feae1c38b07bd131eb4ff79471.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Features &amp; Keywords</strong>:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style racing with realistic physics\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense AI battles with unpredictable racing patterns\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather effects (snow, and night racing for added challenge)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift, overtake and boost mechanics for high-speed cornering\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging visuals and smooth controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/1658180f043efde42dd4456bfb164989.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/1658180f043efde42dd4456bfb164989.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/1658180f043efde42dd4456bfb164989.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buckle up, hit the gas, and become the ultimate champion in Nitro Hyper Racing! Are you ready to dominate the roads and claim the championship?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/8747c1f158c048655f575004416325cf.poster.avif?t=1746192709\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/8747c1f158c048655f575004416325cf.webm?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656220/extras/8747c1f158c048655f575004416325cf.mp4?t=1746192709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
